 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 511448,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Solve this system of linear equations by elimination:\n<br>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}\n  x - 3y =  - 3 \\\\\n  {\\,\\,\\,}x + y = 5 \\\\ \n\\end{array}  \\right.\">\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}\n  x - 3y =  - 3 \\\\\n  x + y = 5 \\\\ \n\\end{array}  \\right.</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p><span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {\\begin{array}{*{20}{c}}\n{x - 3y =  - 3}\\\\\n{x + y = 5}\n\\end{array}} \\right.\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 1: Write both equations in standard form, <span data-math=\"Ax + By = C\"></span>.</p>\n<p>This system already is in standard form.</p>\n<p>Step 2: Make the coefficients of one variable opposites.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( { - 1} \\right)\\left( {x + y} \\right) = \\left( { - 1} \\right)5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - x - y =  - 5\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 3: Add the equations resulting from Step 2 to eliminate one variable.</p> \n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><i>x</i></td>\n<td>–3<i>y</i></td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>–3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>–<i>x</i></td>\n<td>–<i>y</i></td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>–5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SUM:</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>–4<i>y</i></td>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>–8</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Step 4: Solve for the remaining variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\" - 4y =  - 8\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"y = 2\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 5: Substitute the solution from Step 4 into one of the original equations. Solve for the remaining variable.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x + y = 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x + 2 = 5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"x = 3\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 6: Write the solution as an ordered pair.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\left( {3,2} \\right)\"></span></p>\n<p>Step 6: Checking is left to you.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"(3, 2)\">(3, 2)</span>"
    }
   ],
